# Package-scoped: npm's packer (npm pack/publish) resolves .npmignore
# relative to the package being packed, not the monorepo root — the root
# .npmignore's exclusions do NOT apply here. Confirmed empirically via
# `npm pack --dry-run --json` still listing
# templates/hermes/__pycache__/*.pyc after only the root .npmignore was
# updated. See session/v1/EVIDENCE/m5-release.md.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
